# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/ship-4 window (the combined ship candidate; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/ship-4 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job).
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the
# order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-ship-4 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head WITH the K64j-OQ graft (sed -i 's/tp4-ship-4/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file
# the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. This window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# GX0 (STOP): the CONTROL of the exactness pair, on the same image as GX1: the ship candidate profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic over the
# exactness test list (the parked and Lever N equal-answer tests: the same prompts, exact-length completions, content hashes), unaudited. The smoke ends red only by the
# concurrent8_steady list rule (C2_SMOKE_PARTIAL names the omission). Its logs are the reference of GX1. TELEMETRY (C2_TELEMETRY=1, scripts/ci/card_telemetry.py): the
# read-only ARC sidecar samples every chip once a second through the smoke step (AICLK and the limiter holding it, power, current, temperature, kernel NOPs); read
# telemetry-smoke/telemetry-summary.txt beside the result; the first [TELEMETRY] line must say decode check ok. It runs on the host and reads only. Duration (estimate): 15
# minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-ship-4
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,parked_equal,parked_budgets,levern_equal,levern_equal_busy
C2_SMOKE_PARTIAL=exactness control arm: its test list is fixed by the protocol, so concurrent8_steady is not run
C2_BOX_MINUTES=40
C2_TELEMETRY=1
